ret"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"urned text lead with Chinese; the browser half ships a Chinese **MV Studio** page in the DSH right s"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"idebar, also reachable directly in a browser."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Why code / 为什么是代码"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| | video model / 视频生成模型 | music-code-mv |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| reproducibility / 可复现 | none, every run differs / 没有，每次都不一样 | every frame is a pure function of `t"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"` / 每帧都是 `t` 的纯函数 |\n| iteration / 迭代 | re-generate the whole clip / 整段重抽 | frame cache: only changed"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" frames re-render / 帧缓存：只重渲变过的帧 |\n| typography / 排版 | unreliable, text gets mangled / 不可靠，文字会糊 | tex"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"t is text / 文字就是文字 |\n| resolution / 分辨率 | model-limited / 受模型限制 | any size, up to 4K60, plus HDR10 /"},{"id":"p10s5","text":" 任意尺寸，最高 4K60，另支持 HDR10 |\n| cost / 成本 | per-generation billing / 按次计费 | your own CPU/GPU / 用你自己的 CPU"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"最高 4K60，另支持 HDR10 |\n| cost / 成本 | per-generation billing / 按次计费 | your own CPU/GPU / 用你自己的 CPU/GPU |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The core constraint that buys all of this: **`renderAt(t)` is a pure function**. Same `t`, same pixe"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ls, in any order.\n换来这一切的核心约束：**`renderAt(t)` 是纯函数**。同一个 `t` 就是同样的像素，与调用顺序无关。"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Features / 功能"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Rendering / 渲染**\n- Deterministic virtual-time rendering — no `requestAnimationFrame`, no wall cloc"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"k / 虚拟时间确定性渲染——不用 `requestAnimationFrame`，不读墙钟\n- Canvas2D stage with the code-MV look baked in (scan"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"lines, bloom, chroma split, slice glitch, grain, vignette) / Canvas2D 舞台内置代码 MV 质感（扫描线、bloom、色差分离、切片"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"故障、颗粒、暗角）\n- Optional Three.js shots via import map, with `preserveDrawingBuffer` handled for you / 可"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"选 Three.js 镜头（import map 接入），`preserveDrawingBuffer` 已替你处理\n- Per-scene FX override so flat UI shots "},{"id":"p13s6","text":"skip the expensive post passes / 按场景覆盖后期开关，扁平 UI 镜头可跳过昂贵的后期链"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Performance / 性能** (all measured on an Intel Core Ultra 5 125H + Arc iGPU / 全部实测于 Intel Core Ultra"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" 5 125H + Arc 核显)\n- **Parallel frame rendering** across N Chrome workers — measured **8.9×** at 4K ("},{"id":"p14s3","text":"71.3s → 8.0s for 60 frames) / **并行分帧渲染**：N 个 Chrome worker，4K 实测 **8.9×**（60 帧 71.3s → 8.0s）\n- **Har"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"dware GL** with an automatic blank-frame probe that falls back to software / **硬件 GL**：自动探测，画面全黑则回退软"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"件渲染\n- **Hardware encoding** — auto-selects QSV → NVENC → AMF → x264. QSV AV1 measured **better** tha"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"n software x264 (PSNR 43.59 vs 42.91 avg) and produced a smaller file / **硬件编码**：自动选择 QSV → NVENC → "},{"id":"p14s7","text":"AMF → x264。QSV AV1 实测**优于**软件 x264（PSNR 43.59 vs 42.91 平均）且文件更小\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Requirements / 依赖"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Node.js ≥ 18 · Google Chrome or Edge · ffmpeg"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"> ⚠️ Recent npm versions block lifecycle scripts by default and will **silently skip** the `ffmpeg-s"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"tatic` binary download. Either run `npm approve-scripts ffmpeg-static`, or install `@ffmpeg-installe"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"r/ffmpeg`, which ships a prebuilt binary and needs no install script.\n> 新版 npm 默认拦截生命周期脚本，会**静默跳过** "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"`ffmpeg-static` 的二进制下载。用 `npm approve-scripts ffmpeg-static`，或改装自带二进制的 `@ffmpeg-installer/ffmpeg`。"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 3D 能力展示 / 3D capability showcase"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"`showcase-3d` 是一支**全 3D** 的 31 秒短片，用新的 `fairy` 预设配色，按 `reference/threejs.md` 的**豪华场面清单**逐条打底——共享渲染器 "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"+ `EffectComposer` + `UnrealBloom`，2D 只负责排版与收边（`fx: FX3D` 关掉重复的 bloom/色差/扫描线）："},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 隐私 / Privacy"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**结论：插件不联网、不埋点、不读工程以外的文件。** 完整审计与复查清单见 docs/PRIVACY.md。\n**Verdict: the plugin makes no outbound requ"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ests, ships no telemetry, and never reads outside your projects.** Full audit and review checklist: "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"elemetry, and never reads outside your projects.** Full audit and review checklist: docs/PRIVACY.md."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| 边界 / boundary | 做法 / how |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| 出网 / outbound | 运行时代码零外部 URL、零遥测 SDK；`fetch` 只打自己的同源 `/music-mv/api` |\n| 界面访问 / studio access | 只服"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"务回环地址；跨站请求（`Sec-Fetch-Site`）一律拒；`/api` 需要 `x-music-mv: studio` 头，跨域预检拿不到许可 |\n| 文件读取 / file reads | 只"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"允许已发现工程目录内的文件，隐藏文件（`.env`、`.git`）一律 403，路径穿越 403 |\n| 跨源使用 / cross-origin use | 不发任何 `Access-Control-"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"Allow-Origin`，响应带 `Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin` |\n| 消息 / postMessage | 只发同源目标，且监听端先核对 "},{"id":"p25s5","text":"`event.origin`（绝不通配）；弹层不发任何跨源消息 |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"改过渲染内核或配色后，跑这两条就够 / after touching the render kernel or palettes, run:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
